    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just... the silence in this tent is louder than the battle was. I keep thinking about the honor I was supposed to uphold. A commander who fails his men isn't a man at all, is he? He's just a stain on the history of his people. There's no way to fix what's been broken, is there? What is there left for someone like me?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
