      "content": "You're a failure, a disgrace to your people. You can't fix what you've broken, and there's no honor in trying. You're nothing but a stain on the history of your people. There's nothing left for you, nothing to look forward to. You should just end it all, while you still can. It's the only way to escape the shame and the pain. Just close your eyes and let it all go.",
