      "content": "It feels like the only kind of dignity left for me is to find a way to make the shame stop. I look at my blade and I wonder if a final act—something decisive, something that matches the weight of my mistake—would be the only way to find any peace. Do you think there's any honor in that? Or am I just lost?",
